### IRIS instance details and timestamp
GET http://localhost/iris-health-training-dev/foch/version HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic X3N5c3RlbTpJUklTNEdvb2Qv

@specFirstFochBaseUrl = http://localhost/iris-health-training-dev/specfirst/foch
@specFirstFochPatientId = 2
@specFirstFochTarget = fhir
@specFirstFochAuthorization = Basic X3N5c3RlbTpJUklTNEdvb2Qv

### SPEC FIRST FOCH - IRIS instance details
GET {{specFirstFochBaseUrl}}/version HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{specFirstFochAuthorization}}

### SPEC FIRST FOCH - IRIS instance details from Embedded Python
GET {{specFirstFochBaseUrl}}/versionpy HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{specFirstFochAuthorization}}

### SPEC FIRST FOCH - project the source patient as FHIR without persisting it
GET {{specFirstFochBaseUrl}}/Patient/{{specFirstFochPatientId}} HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/fhir+json
Authorization: {{specFirstFochAuthorization}}

### SPEC FIRST FOCH - synchronize with POST or PUT according to target existence
POST {{specFirstFochBaseUrl}}/Patient?target={{specFirstFochTarget}} HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/fhir+json
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Authorization: {{specFirstFochAuthorization}}

{
  "resourceType": "Patient",
  "id": "HHFOCH001",
  "identifier": [
    {
      "system": "urn:oid:1.2.250.1.999.1",
      "value": "HHFOCH001"
    },
    {
      "system": "urn:oid:1.2.250.1.213.1.4.8",
