### SPEC FIRST FOCH - update the home address and force an idempotent FHIR PUT
PUT {{specFirstFochBaseUrl}}/Patient/{{specFirstFochPatientId}}?target={{specFirstFochTarget}} HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/fhir+json
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Authorization: {{specFirstFochAuthorization}}

{
	"resourceType": "Patient",
  "id": "{{specFirstFochPatientId}}",
  "identifier": [],
  "active": true,
  "name": [],
  "telecom": [],
  "gender": "unknown",
	"address": [
		{
			"use": "home",
			"line": [
				"25 rue des Vignes"
			],
			"city": "Suresnes",
			"postalCode": "92500",
			"country": "FR"
		}
	]
}

### SPEC FIRST FOCH - delete the target FHIR Patient and preserve data.patient
DELETE {{specFirstFochBaseUrl}}/Patient/{{specFirstFochPatientId}} HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/fhir+json
Authorization: {{specFirstFochAuthorization}}

