Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic X3N5c3RlbTpJUklTNEdvb2Qv

### FHIR facade - project data.patient ID 1 without persisting it
GET http://localhost/iris-health-training-dev/fhir/Patient/1 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/fhir+json
Authorization: Basic X3N5c3RlbTpJUklTNEdvb2Qv

### FHIR synchronization - POST when IPP is absent, PUT when it already exists
POST http://localhost/iris-health-training-dev/fhir/Patient/1 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/fhir+json
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Authorization: Basic X3N5c3RlbTpJUklTNEdvb2Qv

{
	"resourceType": "Patient",
	"id": "J7720",
	"identifier": [
		{
      "system": "urn:oid:1.2.250.1.999.1",
			"value": "J7720"
		}
	]
}

### FHIR synchronization - force an idempotent PUT
PUT http://localhost/iris-health-training-dev/fhir/Patient/1 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/fhir+json
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Authorization: Basic X3N5c3RlbTpJUklTNEdvb2Qv

{
	"resourceType": "Patient",
	"id": "J7720",
	"identifier": [
		{
      "system": "urn:oid:1.2.250.1.999.1",
			"value": "J7720"
		}
	],
	"address": [
		{
			"use": "home",
			"line": [
				"25 avenue de la Republique"
			],
			"city": "Paris",
			"postalCode": "75011",
			"country": "FR"
		}
	]
}

